Derived from Oxidized as of commit d7f51c2, and modified for glazed:

- glazed/lib/glazed/dialects/{awplus,ios,junos,nec_ix,wlc}.rb
  Prompts, command sequences, output cleanup and secret patterns ported
  from lib/oxidized/model/{awplus,ios,junos,necix,aireos}.rb.
- glazed/spec/fixtures/dialects/ios/*.yaml, glazed/spec/fixtures/dialects/junos/*.yaml
  Device simulations from spec/model/data, and the outputs collected
  from them (*.collected.txt, *.redacted.txt).
- glazed/spec/support/simulation.rb
  Reads Oxidized's device simulation format (spec/model/model_helper.rb).
